p://www.devermore.net/VoD2/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20111122022012/http://www.freewebs.com:80/shoatm/\" target=\"_blank\">https://web.archive.org/web/20111122...com:80/shoatm/</a> Also here's the last page archive of WOD Toolkit's homepage. (Any dates after this one are 302s)</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow. VoD looks awesome. If only someone sat with and ported it to 2E aaand 2017. It would be so great. I'd pay for it - not much but I would pay.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-26T12:21:39-07:00","id":1097213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096810-wanting-to-make-a-character-creation-program?p=1096827#post1096827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any programming background at all? Console/forms based, web, or app?</div> </div> </div> </div>None outside of some very <i>very</i> light stuff for a game, hence why I'm asking what coding language to look into.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moinen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096810-wanting-to-make-a-character-creation-program?p=1096830#post1096830\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a <a href=\"https://community.fantasyflightgames.com/topic/89135-another-character-generator/\" target=\"_blank\">character generator </a>for FF Star Wars that is legally present for quite a while so you can check whats inside. It includes names and titles without any descriptions, do that and you should be fine. As to coding language... try Excel :P While its not a exactly what youre looking for its the easiest and fastest to learn. Here is something already done for the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1035454-google-spreadsheet-character-sheet\">werewolf</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was the plan; I was planning on including a field that could have text written into it under/beside the various things chosen, even if it automatically does what it's supposed to do (for example, Fleet Of Foot would automatically add +1 to your Speed for every dot of it you have when taken).<br /> <br /> Funny enough, this desire partially came about because another person I've played with had entire sheets of automated player character sheets on Google Docs, just not to the extent I was thinking. Cool to see more being done to that effect. While I don't have Excel proper, I do have OpenOffice and its various, similar programs, so I could probably use that if not Google Docs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096810-wanting-to-make-a-character-creation-program?p=1096933#post1096933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is one for new world of darkness.<br /> <br /> Its called WOD toolkit</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tezof</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096810-wanting-to-make-a-character-creation-program?p=1097085#post1097085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vault of Darkness is excellent, if 1E and lacking Hunter plus others.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.devermore.net/VoD2/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20111122022012/http://www.freewebs.com:80/shoatm/\" target=\"_blank\">https://web.archive.org/web/20111122...com:80/shoatm/</a> Also here's the last page archive of WOD Toolkit's homepage. (Any dates after this one are 302s)</div> </div> </div> </div>I was unaware of this previously; very interesting. I shall look into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T02:17:27-07:00","id":1098709,"title":"","content":"look at javascript and html with css. It's most portable solution right now, you could run it on webpage or create app for any mobile platform.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>[avatar artwork and character are by awesome goattrain]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13487-renha","name":"Renha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}